      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOILER MAKER (1) missed the frame last time after colliding with another runner in a Grade 4 at this track, finishing a 2.25 lengths fourth (17.36). Little luck latest and can atone. BENNY THE BULL (2) hit the ground running from the squeeze draw with a slick early split, holding on for a minor placing when second and beaten 2.25 lengths at this track over 400m in 22.74. Comes through a solid form race last start. Expected to feature again. GLOW GIRL (7) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 6 lengths at Northam in a handy 17.23 beating Fearless Parker. The form out of last race has been strong. Hard to fault her form and she makes plenty of appeal. INVESTED (8) is a last start winner who rates one of the chances again.",
